  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1223200,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "### 1869 - History Experience Part I (Commodore Amiga)\n\n**Chart your course to fortune in 1869!**\n\nStep into the boots of a 19th-century merchant seeking to build a trading empire on the Commodore Amiga. *1869 - History Experience Part I* is a management and economic simulation where shrewd planning and careful risk assessment are your greatest assets. Begin with a single ship, recruit a crew, and load your cargo, then set sail to distant ports, exploiting market demands for profit.\n\nForget swashbuckling action; your journey is one of strategic navigation. Plot your routes, manage resources, and watch time pass as you contend with random events and lucrative special assignments. Expand your fleet, establish reliable trade routes, and strive to become the head of a powerful trading company.  Success demands more than just trading acumen; knowledge of shipbuilding, nautical science, and global politics is vital.  Compete for a place on the \"List of the Best\" in single-player mode, or eliminate rivals for a knockout victory in multiplayer! Can you amass the greatest shipping firm before time runs out?"
    },
